y consumption", "D": "Shorten train lengths"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q2fdoy18aknp"}, {"q": "The 'engine on line' figure used in utilisation excludes locos", "options": {"A": "On goods trains", "B": "Under repair or overhaul", "C": "On passenger trains", "D": "In multiple operation"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q242iv6bvozo"}, {"q": "Detention registers at loco sheds record", "options": {"A": "Waiting time of each loco with reasons", "B": "Passenger complaints", "C": "Ticket sales", "D": "Parcel weights"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q14mnmxkoggk"}, {"q": "Multiple-unit operation of locos affects engine kms because", "options": {"A": "Only one loco counts", "B": "Kilometres are halved", "C": "Kilometres are ignored", "D": "Each working loco earns its own engine kms"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1rz9gk3cknu"}, {"q": "High specific energy consumption in ghat sections is mainly due to", "options": {"A": "Coasting downhill", "B": "Regenerative braking", "C": "Steep gradients and slow speeds", "D": "Light train loads"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q16i0gsrwsk8"}, {"q": "Engine availability targets are set to ensure", "options": {"A": "Fewer trains run", "B": "Enough fit locos for planned traffic", "C": "More workshop repairs", "D": "Longer detentions"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qohqouaawng"}, {"q": "Wasted detention at fuelling points is cut by", "options": {"A": "Better fuelling schedules and planning", "B": "Slower fuelling", "C": "More detentions", "D": "Longer halts"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1b6qjltdf05"}, {"q": "A 'banker' attached at the rear of a goods train records", "options": {"A": "Passenger kms", "B": "Shunting hours", "C": "Assisting engine kilometres", "D": "Nothing at all"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q18whepphqfq"}, {"q": "Engine hours are a better measure than engine kms for", "options": {"A": "High-speed runs", "B": "Long hauls", "C": "Downhill coasting", "D": "Shunting-intensive duties"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q22wmj9wj6w8"}, {"q": "Fuel economy of a diesel loco is reported", "options": {"A